1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
成都的饺子，不蘸醋
Chengdu dumplings skip the vinegar

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
浇一勺红油，甜辣裹满
A spoon of red oil, sweet and spicy

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
钟水饺，1893年生于荔枝巷
Zhong dumplings, born 1893

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
只用全猪肉，不加一片菜
Pure pork, not a leaf of veg

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
红油，用二荆条辣椒现炼
Chili oil from Erjingtiao peppers

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
酱油要"复制"：红糖香料熬
Soy "remade" with sugar and spice

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
微甜、带咸、还有股辣
Sweet, salty, then a slow heat

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
干拌不带汤，红亮挂勺
No broth — glossy red on the spoon

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
北方配醋，成都配红糖辣油
North: vinegar; Chengdu: sweet chili

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
一口下去，巴适得板
One bite — "bāshì de bǎn"

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,200
同是饺子，甜辣还是酸？
Same dumpling — sweet-spicy or sour?

12
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,400
下集：过年，为什么都吃它
Next: why New Year needs it

